CodeSystem: CommonConditionsElementsCS
Id: common-conditions-elements-cs
Title: "Common Conditions Elements CodeSystem"
Description: "A CodeSystem defining specific CCEs to be used in a consent"

* ^status = #active
* ^experimental = true

* #LEGAL_AND_REGULATORY_FRAMEWORK "Legal and Regulatory Framework"
  "Use undertaken subject to one or more particular legal or regulatory frameworks"

* #COMMERCIAL_ENTITY "Commercial Entity"
  "Use undertaken by a commercial organisation, regardless of whether that use is profit motivated"

* #RETURN_TO_PROVIDER "Return to Provider"
  "Use that is subject to one or more requirements regarding the return of one or more types of data, results or materials to the provider"

* #PARTICIPANT_RECONTACT "Participant Recontact"
  "Use that is subject to one or more policies regarding making contact with study participants"

* #IMMORTALISED_CELL_LINES "Immortalised Cell Lines"
  "Use that involves producing cell lines that are capable of indefinite proliferation"

* #INDUCED_PLURIPOTENT_STEM_CELLS "Induced Pluripotent Stem Cells"
  "Generation of IPSC from the participants' samples"

* #ORGANOIDS "Organoids"
  "Use that involves producing organoids"

* #DATA_LINKAGE "Data Linkage"
  "Use that involves record-level linking to additional data"

* #DATA_SAMPLE_POST_MORTEM "Data/Sample Post Mortem"
  "Use of samples/data after the death of the research participant"

* #NUCLEIC_ACID_SEQUENCE "Nucleic Acid Sequence"
  "Use that involves producing DNA or RNA sequence information about one or more individuals"

* #ARTIFICIAL_INTELLIGENCE "Artificial Intelligence"
  "Use that involves some form of artificial intelligence, machine learning, or large language model processing of data"
